        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\n  \&quot;theme\&quot;: \&quot;base\&quot;,\n  \&quot;themeVariables\&quot;: {\n    \&quot;background\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;lineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;secondaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;tertiaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorBkg\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorBorder\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorLineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;signalColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;signalTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelBoxBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelBoxBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;loopTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;activationBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;activationBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;\n  }\n}}%%\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Employee\n    participant UI as Booking Page\n    participant Action as Booking Action\n    participant UseCase as Book Drop-Off Use Case\n    participant Repository as Booking Repository\n    participant DB as Supabase\n\n    Employee-&gt;&gt;UI: Select stop and departure time\n    activate UI\n    UI--&gt;&gt;Employee: Display booking review\n    deactivate UI\n    Employee-&gt;&gt;UI: Confirm booking\n    activate UI\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Action: createBooking(userId, stopId, departureTime)\n    activate Action\n    Action-&gt;&gt;Action: Validate stop and departure time\n\n    alt Invalid input\n        Action--&gt;&gt;UI: Return validation error\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Employee: Display error\n    else Valid input\n        Action-&gt;&gt;UseCase: execute(input)\n        activate UseCase\n        UseCase-&gt;&gt;Repository: findActiveForUser(userId)\n        activate Repository\n        Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query unresolved booking\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Existing booking or null\n        deactivate DB\n\n\n        alt Active booking exists\n            Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Existing booking\n            deactivate Repository\n            UseCase--&gt;&gt;Action: DuplicateBookingError\n            Action--&gt;&gt;UI: Return duplicate-booking error\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Employee: Display error\n        else No active booking\n            UseCase-&gt;&gt;Repository: create(input)\n            activate Repository\n            Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Insert booking\n            activate DB\n            DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Created booking\n            deactivate DB\n            Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Booking\n            deactivate Repository\n            UseCase--&gt;&gt;Action: Booking created\n            deactivate UseCase\n            Action--&gt;&gt;UI: Return success\n            deactivate Action\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Employee: Display booking confirmation\n            deactivate UI\n        end\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="pqYSD8LCPZauJVcyPg6G-1">
